      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "1 to 3\n\nFrequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The mitflits thrust with their shortswords, coordinated with bites from their giant vermin mounts. All enemies in a 5-foot emanation must attempt a DC 18 basic Reflex save save. The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n1 1d6 piercing damage\n\n2 2d6+4 piercing damage\n\n3 2d6+8 piercing damage",
