      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The mitflit vermin cavalry Leaps up to 30 feet. If it moves at least 15 feet, the cavalry deals 2d6+4 piercing damage (DC 18 basic Reflex save save) to each enemy within a 5-foot emanation at the end of its movement."
